{
  "path": "/detail/chatbot-hub",
  "title": "챗봇 허브",
  "desc": "배포된 챗봇을 쓰고, 신청하고, 관리하는 곳",
  "toc": [],
  "html": "<p>챗봇 허브는 <strong>배포된 워크플로우를 대화 형태로 쓰는 곳</strong>입니다.\n개인이 쓰는 챗봇과 조직 전체에 열리는 시스템 챗봇이 나뉘고, 시스템 챗봇은 승인을 거칩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container\"><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/overview\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">챗봇허브 이해하기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>개인 챗봇과 시스템 챗봇의 차이, 전체 흐름</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/permissions\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">권한에 따라 보이는 메뉴</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>배포 권한과 관리 권한이 각각 무엇을 열어주는지</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/use-chatbot\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">신규 채팅</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>챗봇을 골라 대화 시작하기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/browse\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">챗봇 둘러보기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>시스템 챗봇과 개인 챗봇 목록 살펴보기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/deploy\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">챗봇 배포하기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우를 개인 챗봇 또는 시스템 챗봇으로 배포하기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/request-status\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">시스템 챗봇 신청 현황</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>내가 올린 신청이 어디까지 갔는지 확인하기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub/management\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">시스템 챗봇 관리</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>배포 현황, 승인 요청 처리, 사용 통계</p></div></a></div>"
}